Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.53,0:02:34.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Having a phone has finally paid off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.53,0:02:34.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不错  我装上电话  终于物有所值了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.86,0:02:39.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know you do do a good Bob impression...
