Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.14,0:04:30.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根本不明白  我们赚的钱没他们多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.05,0:04:34.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes. They always say let's go here, let's go there.
