Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.53,0:04:57.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在上班
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.76,0:05:00.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...just an ordinary day, chop, chop, saute, saute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.76,0:05:00.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟往常一样工作  切切切  煎煎煎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.15,0:05:05.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Suddenly, Leon, the manager, calls me into his office.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.15,0:05:05.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}突然间  我们经理李昂叫我去他的办公室
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.21,0:05:08.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It turns out they fired the lunch chef, and guess who got the job?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.21,0:05:08.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}原来他们开除了午餐大厨  你们猜谁顶上了  
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.46,0:05:10.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If it's not you, this is a horrible story.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.46,0:05:10.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果不是你的话  那就太讨厌了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.28,0:05:14.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fortunately, it is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.28,0:05:14.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}幸好  就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.17,0:05:17.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And they made me head of purchasing,  thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.17,0:05:17.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们还升我为采购主任  感激不尽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.84,0:05:19.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.84,0:05:19.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.32,0:05:21.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, I just ran into Ross and Chandler downstairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.32,0:05:21.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚在楼下碰见了罗斯和钱德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.50,0:05:22.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and they think we should go out and celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.50,0:05:22.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们觉得我们该出去庆祝一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.75,0:05:24.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, someplace nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.75,0:05:24.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去个好地方
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.43,0:05:31.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Someplace nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.43,0:05:31.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去个好地方
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.28,0:05:33.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How much you think I can get for my kidney?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.28,0:05:33.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们觉得我的肾能卖多少钱  
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.42,0:05:43.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm tellin' you. You can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.42,0:05:43.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说真的  你不能这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.50,0:05:46.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on. I can't get a girl like that with conventional methods.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.50,0:05:46.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要是走传统路线  我永远把不到那种尤物
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.74,0:05:50.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That doesn't matter. She wanted to call Bob. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.74,0:05:50.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那有什么关系呢  她要找的是鲍勃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.59,0:05:54.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, for all we know, Bob is who she was meant to be with. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.59,0:05:54.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}鲍勃一定是她理想的对象
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.20,0:05:57.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You may be destroying two people's  chance for happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.20,0:05:57.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你这么做或许会毁了两个人幸福快乐的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.36,0:05:58.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We don't know Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.36,0:05:58.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不认识鲍勃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.80,0:06:02.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We know me. We like me. Please let me be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.80,0:06:02.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们认识我  我们喜欢我  拜托  让我快乐起来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.48,0:06:07.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go over there and tell that woman the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.48,0:06:07.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你过去告诉那个女人实话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.80,0:06:09.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.80,0:06:09.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.29,0:06:12.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.29,0:06:12.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.32,0:06:24.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen, I have to....
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.32,0:06:24.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是这样  我要...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.12,0:06:27.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have to confess something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.12,0:06:27.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要向你坦白一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.00,0:06:28.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.00,0:06:28.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么事  
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.31,0:06:33.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whoever stood you up is a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.31,0:06:33.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}放你鸽子的人是混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.81,0:06:36.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- How did you - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.81,0:06:36.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你怎么...  -我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.85,0:06:43.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just had this weird sense. But that's me, I'm weird and sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.85,0:06:43.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有第六感  我就是这样  古怪而敏感
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.28,0:06:47.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tissue?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.28,0:06:47.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}面纸  
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.52,0:06:49.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.52,0:06:49.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:52.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, you keep the pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:52.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不用  你留着用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.46,0:06:55.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm all cried out today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.46,0:06:55.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我今天已经"哭"干了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.94,0:07:14.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here is to my sister, the newly appointed head lunch chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.94,0:07:14.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这杯敬我刚刚被升为午餐大厨的老妹
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.82,0:07:16.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who is also in charge of purchasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.82,0:07:16.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在还负责采购
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.74,0:07:19.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Newly appointed head lunch chef who is also in charge of purchasing...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.74,0:07:19.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恭贺她荣升为午餐大厨  还负责采购
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.94,0:07:22.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who has her own little desk when Roland's not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.94,0:07:22.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗兰不在的时候  她还有自己的小办公桌
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.34,0:07:27.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Lunch chef, purchasing, own little desk when Roland's not there...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.34,0:07:27.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}午餐大厨  采购  罗兰不在时  有自己的小办公桌
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.99,0:07:31.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- here's to my little sis... - Wait! And I got a beeper!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.99,0:07:31.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-敬我的老妹...  -等等  我还有传呼器
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.70,0:07:32.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.70,0:07:32.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.60,0:07:36.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's fine, I'll just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.60,0:07:36.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系  我等好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.78,0:07:38.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.78,0:07:38.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.83,0:07:40.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.83,0:07:40.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}敬摩妮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.05,0:07:45.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are we ready to order?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.05,0:07:45.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位可以点菜了吗  
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.33,0:07:47.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? We haven't even looked yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.33,0:07:47.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起  我们还没看菜单
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.25,0:07:48.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When you do, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.25,0:07:48.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你们看过之后再叫我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.02,0:07:51.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll be over there on the edge of my seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.02,0:07:51.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会在那边引颈而盼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.45,0:07:59.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at these prices!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.45,0:07:59.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看这些标价
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.13,0:08:01.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, these are pretty "cha-ching."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.13,0:08:01.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是呀  跟"抢钱"似的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.13,0:08:01.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}收银机的开关声
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.99,0:08:04.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know! What are these, famous chickens?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.99,0:08:04.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这些是什么  名牌鸡吗  
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.10,0:08:10.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Sorry I'm late. Congratulations, Mon. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.10,0:08:10.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-抱歉  我迟到了  恭喜你  摩妮卡  -谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.04,0:08:12.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not sorry I'm late. How incredible was my afternoon with Jade?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.04,0:08:12.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不后悔迟到  我跟洁德的午后约会太美妙了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.29,0:08:18.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, pretty incredible according to the message she left you on my machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.29,0:08:18.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从她在我答录机上给你的留言看来  的确很美妙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.20,0:08:22.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Chandler, why is this woman leaving a message for you on my machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.20,0:08:22.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德勒  她为什么会在我的答录机留话给你呢  
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.84,0:08:25.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, see, I had to tell her that my number was your number, 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.84,0:08:25.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我必须要告诉她  我的号码是你的号码...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.07,0:08:27.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}because I couldn't tell her that my number was my number
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.07,0:08:27.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我不能告诉她  我的号码是我的号码...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.12,0:08:29.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}because she thinks that my number is Bob's number.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.12,0:08:29.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为她以为  我的号码是鲍勃的号码
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.38,0:08:34.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tell me again. What do I do when Mr. Roper calls?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.38,0:08:34.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你再说一次  罗柏先生来电时我怎么办  
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.61,0:08:37.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do I dare ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.61,0:08:37.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以点菜了吗  
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.03,0:08:41.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. I'll start with the carpaccio, and then the grilled prawns.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.03,0:08:41.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好  我要先来一份生牛肉  然后再来一份烤虾
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.54,0:08:43.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That sounds great. Same for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.54,0:08:43.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听起来不错  我也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.45,0:08:44.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And for the gentleman?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.45,0:08:44.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那这位先生呢  
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.76,0:08:46.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll have the Thai chicken pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.76,0:08:46.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要泰国鸡肉披萨
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.00,0:08:50.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But if I get it without the nuts and leeks and stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.00,0:08:50.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我的披萨不加干果和大葱什么的...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.04,0:08:51.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is it cheaper?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.04,0:08:51.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会不会便宜点  
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.50,0:08:53.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'd think, wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.50,0:08:53.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得可能吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.24,0:08:56.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.24,0:08:56.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小姐呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.14,0:09:00.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ok, I will have the side salad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.14,0:09:00.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了  我想要点配餐沙拉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.10,0:09:03.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And what would that be on the side of?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.10,0:09:03.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那要配在什么菜旁边呢  
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.07,0:09:05.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.07,0:09:05.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.31,0:09:07.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you put it right here next to my water?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.31,0:09:07.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就帮我放在我的水旁边好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:11.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:11.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你呢  
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.08,0:09:18.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna have a cup of the cucumber soup and...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.08,0:09:18.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我要来一碗黄瓜汤  还有...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.51,0:09:21.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.51,0:09:21.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}走好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.76,0:09:27.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I will have the Cajun catfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.76,0:09:27.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要一份卡津鲶鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.11,0:09:28.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.11,0:09:28.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还要别的吗 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.32,0:09:30.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, how about a verse of "Killing Me Softly"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.32,0:09:30.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给我吟诵一首《温柔杀手》怎么样  
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.92,0:09:34.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're gonna sneeze in my fish, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.92,0:09:34.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会朝我的鱼打喷嚏  对不对  
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.33,0:09:44.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Plus tip, divided by six....
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.33,0:09:44.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}加上小费  再除以六
